# 43. TIMELINE ANALYSIS

Timeline analysis is extremely important.

Suppose:

```text
10:00 — Initial compromise
10:03 — New account created
10:05 — New scheduled task created
10:06 — Outbound connection
10:10 — User logs out
10:11 — Scheduled task executes
```

This relationship may strongly suggest persistence.

