# 59. SAFE LAB EXERCISE

Create a controlled persistence investigation rather than deploying a real malicious persistence mechanism.

## Step 1

Record baseline:

```text
Accounts
Services
Scheduled Tasks
Processes
Network connections
Startup items
```

## Step 2

Create a clearly identifiable **benign lab task/service** using your own test VM.

Example name:

```text
CyberLab-Test
```

## Step 3

Record:

```text
Creation time
Creator
Trigger
Executable
Permissions
```

## Step 4

Reboot/log out as appropriate.

## Step 5

Verify whether the benign lab mechanism executes.

## Step 6

Remove it.

## Step 7

Confirm it is gone.

The learning objective is:

```text
CREATE
 ↓
OBSERVE
 ↓
DETECT
 ↓
REMOVE
 ↓
VERIFY
```

