## ⭐ Most important Day 41 concept

> **Persistence is not simply "getting access." It is maintaining the ability to execute or regain access after the original session or access path is lost. For exams, remember: Windows → Registry/Tasks/Services/Startup; Linux → Cron/systemd/SSH/Startup. A single persistence indicator is not proof of compromise—always validate and correlate.**